Package: ndiclient
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: John Ellis <john@deckerego.net>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: avahi-daemon
Section: video
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/deckerego/ndiclient
Description: command line NDI video receiver
 ndiclient finds an NDI source on the network by device and stream name
 and shows its video in a desktop window or fullscreen. Run without
 arguments, it lists the NDI sources it discovers.
 .
 This package bundles the NDI runtime library (libndi) privately in
 /usr/lib/ndiclient.
 .
 NDI is a registered trademark of Vizrt NDI AB. See https://ndi.video/
